LEVI Windows startup options

PREPARE ONCE

cd /d D:\Projects\LEVI
py -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install -r requirements.txt

NATIVE DESKTOP WINDOW (PREFERRED)

cd /d D:\Projects\LEVI
desktop\run-native-dev.bat

The script starts the FastAPI backend and Vite development server, then opens LEVI in a native Electron window.

BROWSER FALLBACK

cd /d D:\Projects\LEVI
desktop\run-browser-dev.bat

The script opens separate backend and frontend terminals and then opens the local UI in the default browser.

MANUAL BACKEND COMMAND

cd /d D:\Projects\LEVI
.venv\Scripts\activate
set LEVI_REPO_ROOT=D:\Projects\LEVI
set LEVI_REPO_POLL_SECONDS=1.0
cd backend
python -m uvicorn main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000

